### JetBrains style, path split over lines
GET http://example.com/
    api
    /get
Accept: application/json

### VS Code style query lines
GET https://example.com/comments
    ?page=2
    &pageSize=10
&sort=desc

### Indented query after a full URL
GET https://example.com/search?q=birds
    &limit=5 HTTP/1.1
